  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Capacity of Law Enforcement Agencies in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a multi year project (3 years) aiming at improving natural resources governance though enhancement in environmental law in Indonesia. the project will provide training and improve coordination to solve several examples of environmental crimes. This project will also increase the capacity of and facilitate civil society participation (media and local NGOs) to monitor, analyse, report and participate in solving environmental cases.</narrative>
  </description>
